<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 713 mln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 713 mln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to December 13 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to December 5  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,447	 37,160</p>
<p> Money market intervention    12,635	 11,598</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,998	  5,991</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,271	  2,271</p>
<p> Total assets		     65,292	 65,734</p>
<p>In the previous week to December 5 reserves rose by 176 million markka.	 --Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
